r the step.","The allocation creates duties of 2 A and 6 B; it does not discharge them.","rebate(amount) can discharge the B rebate. S13 has no allocation_reserve discharge action."],"dependencies":["Give a distinct governance decision its named authentication path where the policy requires one.","Bind actual beneficiaries, fees, custody, and the continuing reserve duties.","Full backing is proposed application policy, beyond source non-negative custody.","A reserve-duty discharge or migration requires additional program work."],"sourceRefs":[{"label":"Conditional reserve source","document":"S13-conditional-reserve.mori","pointer":"actions allocate, rebate"},{"label":"Selected treasury case","document":"CONCEPT.md","pointer":"#five-application-cases"},{"label":"Treasury page card","document":"MESSAGING.md","pointer":"#five-use-case-cards"},{"label":"CL-25","document":"CLAIMS-REGISTER.json","pointer":"/claims/24"},{"label":"CL-52","document":"CLAIMS-REGISTER.json","pointer":"/claims/51"},{"label":"Opus 5.5 ERR-09","document":"SECURITY-ERRATA.json","pointer":"/rows/8"},{"label":"Opus 5.5 ERR-21","document":"SECURITY-ERRATA.json","pointer":"/rows/20"},{"label":"Opus 5.5 ERR-24","document":"SECURITY-ERRATA.json","pointer":"/rows/23"},{"label":"Opus 5.5 ERR-28","document":"SECURITY-ERRATA.json","pointer":"/rows/27"}]}],"invoice":{"format":"moriarty-webs-invoice-worksheet/1","status":"INDEPENDENT_EXPECTED_ARITHMETIC_ONLY","title":"One partial payment, shown in full","description":"Local arithmetic from the supplied source, not Moriarty execution, proof verification, or settlement.","sourceRefs":[{"label":"Invoice source","document":"S12-installment-invoice.mori","pointer":"actions open, partial, finish"},{"label":"CL-20","document":"CLAIMS-REGISTER.json","pointer":"/claims/19"},{"label":"CL-26","document":"CLAIMS-REGISTER.json","pointer":"/claims/25"},{"label":"CL-52","document":"CLAIMS-REGISTER.json","pointer":"/claims/51"},{"label":"Opus 5.5 ERR-22","document":"SECURITY