oriarty/1 to Cardano lowering or validator exists [M-NOCODE, M-REV2 s6 item 1]; legacy source/5 Aiken lowering is stale for current claims [M-REV2 s4].\",\n      \"status\": \"source-backed-candidate\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"As MCP-CTX-01.\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Supplies unique head consumption that the Midnight /1 path leaves as a premise (SEC-06 per T09).\",\n      \"experiment\": \"T02 E2: reuse a proof against a different outref (script-level reject) versus double spend (ledger reject); the two failures must be distinguishable.\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"Unspentness of a remote or past output (MCP-LED-07).\",\n      \"category\": \"c\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-LIN-01@1\",\n      \"supersedes\": \"MCP-LIN-01@0\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"F13: unpinned TxInfo field-list source; installed Preprod API not established\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1-draft-20261015\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-LIN-06\",\n      \"version\": \"1\",\n      \"family\": \"LIN\",\n      \"title\": \"Bounded multi-parent consumption equals proof parent list\",\n      \"property\": \"A join transaction spends exactly the k <= K thread-token UTxOs listed in the proof statement; duplicates are impossible (inputs form a set) given token uniqueness.\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"ledger-current-context\",\n      \"temporalScope\": \"current transaction\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"T06\",\n        \"S-REVIEW-CAT\"\n      ],\n      \"publicInputs\": \"Ordered parent list [tid_i, C_i] in one digest.\",\n      \"privateWitness\": \"Parent openings.\",\n      \"anchorAndAssumptions\": \"LIN-01, LIN-02; one designated validator with forwarding. Field list per an unpinned plutus master capture [S-PV3CTX]; the installed Preprod ledger/Plutus API is not established by it (config MinNodeVersion 11.1.0 [P-CONFIG]).\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"Exactly the application of this transaction; disappears with the transaction on rollback.\",\n     