ith the transaction on rollback.\",\n      \"strategy\": \"Validator reads the field and recomputes it into the statement digest; a Groth16 proof never supplies it. Groth16 adds nothing to authenticity here.\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"No current Rust moriarty/1 to Cardano lowering or validator exists [M-NOCODE, M-REV2 s6 item 1]; legacy source/5 Aiken lowering is stale for current claims [M-REV2 s4].\",\n      \"status\": \"source-backed-candidate\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"Positional DutyCell = Constr0[present in {0,1}, amount in [0,2^128)] over the closed duty universe U, with canonical absent (0,0) (dispositions DR-1/DR-2 [M-DISPOSITIONS as quoted]); the full /1 Snapshot datum layout is still missing.\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Snapshot predecessor for an action; absent versus present-zero duty must round-trip distinctly [T01 E2, T06 E1]. Reads: LiabilityPresent on an absent slot is false and LiabilityAmount is 0; neither read refuses (MCP-EXE-03@1).\",\n      \"experiment\": \"Encode three duty states (absent, present-zero, positive) into the datum layout and check that decoding is injective.\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"Correctness of the datum content beyond what the predecessor transition enforced.\",\n      \"category\": \"c\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-CTX-02@1\",\n      \"supersedes\": \"MCP-CTX-02@0\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"F11: positional DutyCell and non-refusing reads\",\n        \"F13\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1-draft-20261015\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-CTX-03\",\n      \"version\": \"1\",\n      \"family\": \"CTX\",\n      \"title\": \"Reference input read without consumption\",\n      \"property\": \"r is a reference input: its resolved output exists in the UTxO set when this transaction is applied, and it is not consumed. At protocol version >= 11 the same outref may also be spent in this transaction (MCP-CTX-13@0).\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"ledger-current-context\",\n      \"te