t protocol version >= 11 one outref may be both spent and referenced in a transaction (review B sec. 2.2, citing ledger disjointRefInputs at cardano-ledger master 6654c3e5). A consumer counting run claims counts only txInfoInputs members that are not also in txInfoReferenceInputs and whose claim token is burned exactly -1 in this transaction, de-duplicated by asset name; a run-claim outref that also appears in txInfoReferenceInputs makes the settlement reject.\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"ledger-current-context\",\n      \"temporalScope\": \"current transaction\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"S-REVIEW-B\",\n        \"S-PV3CTX\"\n      ],\n      \"publicInputs\": \"None (validator-recomputed).\",\n      \"privateWitness\": \"None.\",\n      \"anchorAndAssumptions\": \"Plutus V3 phase-2: the ledger constructs ScriptContext/TxInfo; no prover-supplied root. Relative to the chain fork the transaction is applied on; no finality. Installed Preprod protocol version and ledger build are not established (PV 11.0 is provider-reported, MCP-OBS-02).\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"Exactly the application of this transaction; disappears with the transaction on rollback.\",\n      \"strategy\": \"Validator-side counting rule; UNIT reference model mcpcat.rules.count_run_claims over abstract sets (not S_settle0).\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"Pure host reference model and UNIT tests in this task only; no validator.\",\n      \"status\": \"source-backed-candidate\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"An adopted S_settle0 ABI (review B sec. 5 is PROPOSED, not adopted).\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Required before any multi-claim settlement counts claims.\",\n      \"experiment\": \"Review B Y2: overlap rejected; a no-dedupe mutant double-counts (UNIT RUL-T02/T03 here).\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"Behaviour of the installed Preprod ledger; any deployed validator.\",\n      \"category\": \"c\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-CTX-13@0\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"F10 / review-B R3, PVC-08'\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1-draft-20261015\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-LIN-08\",\n      \"version\": \"0\",\n      \"family\": \"LIN\",\n      \"title\": \"Thread termination or migration preserves present duties\",\n      \"property\": \"A transition that terminates a thread (burns its thread token) or migrates it must not drop any present duty: every slot with presence 1 before the transition is carried to a successor state or the transition refuses.\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"universal-property\",\n      \"temporalScope\": \"all terminating or migrating executions of a program\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"S-REVIEW-CAT\",\n        \"M-CONTRACT\"\n      ],\n      \"publicInputs\": \"program identity (layer 2), property hash.\",\n      \"privateWitness\": \"n/a\",\n      \"anchorAndAssumptions\": \"Property-checker soundness; duty encoding of MCP-EXE-03@1.\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"Valid while the program identity is unchanged.\",\n      \"strategy\": \"Universal certificate (PROP-01 style) over termination/migration actions.\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"None.\",\n      \"status\": \"research-only\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"No examined /1 construct or catalogue row defines thread termination or token burn with present duties [GAP]; pattern family S04 owes it.\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Residual duties survive partial progress and termination [M-CONTRACT].\",\n      \"experiment\": \"A migration that drops a present-zero duty must fail the certificate; one that carries it must pass.\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"Anything today.\",\n      \"category\": \"c\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-LIN-08@0\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"S-REVIEW-CAT sec. 8 S04: add a v1 row\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1-draft-20261015\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-LIN-09\",\n      \"version\": \"0\",\n      \"family\": \"LIN\",\n      \"title\": \"Thread genesis mint transaction facts\",\n      \"property\": \"In the transaction that mints the thread token under policy h: seed s is consumed, exactly +1 of the fixed asset name is minted, and the genesis output carrying the token is checked by the policy against the program's initial state.\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"ledger-current-context\",\n      \"temporalScope\": \"the genesis mint transaction\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"T01\",\n        \"T10\",\n        \"S-REVIEW-CAT\"\n      ],\n      \"publicInputs\": \"Thread policy id, seed outref s.\",\n      \"privateWitness\": \"None.\",\n      \"anchorAndAssumptions\": \"Plutus V3 phase-2: the ledger constructs ScriptContext/TxInfo; no prover-supplied root. Relative to the chain fork the transaction is applied on; no finality. Field list per an unpinned plutus master capture [S-PV3CTX]; the installed Preprod ledger/Plutus API is not established by it (config MinNodeVersion 11.1.0 [P-CONFIG]).\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"Exactly the application of this transaction; disappears with the transaction on rollback.\",\n      \"strategy\": \"Ledger-native; validator/policy recomputes.\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"None.\",\n      \"status\": \"source-backed-candidate\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"Genesis datum validation against program initial state [T03 s3].\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Base case of MCP-PROP-04@1 together with MCP-LIN-02@1.\",\n      \"experiment\": \"T10 E4: a fake genesis minted without consuming the seed must fail; a genesis output with a non-initial datum must fail.\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"Uniqueness after the mint (MCP-LIN-02@1); later transitions.\",\n      \"category\": \"c\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-LIN-09@0\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"F8: LIN-02 quantifier split, part (i)\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1-draft-20261015\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-AST-04\",\n      \"version\": \"0\",\n      \"family\": \"AST\",\n      \"title\": \"Issuer identity,