ocal measurement under Aiken's cost model, not the Preprod epoch-319 model.\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"Cost-model specific.\",\n      \"strategy\": \"Budget input only; never merged with external records.\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"Reported [X-G16REPORT as quoted by S-REVIEW-CAT sec. 5; author-reported; independent full audit running; nothing here approves any cryptography].\",\n      \"status\": \"experiment-recorded-unaudited\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"Re-measure under the Preprod epoch-319 cost model.\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Budget input only.\",\n      \"experiment\": \"Track 05 E3 under the pinned Preprod cost model.\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"Fit under Preprod; any ledger fact.\",\n      \"category\": \"b\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-REC-03@0\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"G16-COND: local measurement as its own row\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1-draft-20261015\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-LED-12\",\n      \"version\": \"0\",\n      \"family\": \"LED\",\n      \"title\": \"Cardano ledger protocol-parameter and cost-model authenticity at an epoch\",\n      \"property\": \"The Cardano ledger protocol parameters and cost models in force at epoch E are a stated set.\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"ledger-historical-anchored\",\n      \"temporalScope\": \"epoch E\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"P-MITHCERTS\",\n        \"P-EP319\",\n        \"S-REVIEW-CAT\"\n      ],\n      \"publicInputs\": \"anchor, E, parameter-set hash.\",\n      \"privateWitness\": \"n/a\",\n      \"anchorAndAssumptions\": \"No inspected anchor commits to Cardano ledger parameters; Mithril next_protocol_parameters most likely concerns Mithril parameters [INF].\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"Epoch E.\",\n      \"strategy\": \"None available.\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"Provider observation only (MCP-OBS-02@1).\",\n      \"status\": \"unsupported-now\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"No anchor.\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"CardanoTarget pinning stays a provider-observed premise [M-REV2 M11].\",\n      \"experiment\": \"n/a until an anchor exists.\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"Anything today.\",\n      \"category\": \"d\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-LED-12@0\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"F9: LED-05 split\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1-draft-20261015\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-REF-09\",\n      \"version\": \"0\",\n      \"family\": \"REF\",\n      \"title\": \"Statement commits to the carrying transaction's id, redeemers, script-integrity hash or indices\",\n      \"property\": \"A proof verified in transaction T whose statement contains txid(T), a redeemer hash or script-integrity hash of T, or an input/redeemer index of T.\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"anti-pattern\",\n      \"temporalScope\": \"n/a\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"S-REVIEW-CAT\",\n        \"S-REVIEW-B\"\n      ],\n      \"publicInputs\": \"n/a\",\n      \"privateWitness\": \"n/a\",\n      \"anchorAndAssumptions\": \"Hash fixed point through the script-integrity hash; sorted-input index instability (review B R2).\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"n/a\",\n      \"strategy\": \"Refuse by typed statement-field semantics (CAT_FORBIDDEN_CARRYING_TX_FIELD).\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"UNIT catalogue checker rule in this task.\",\n      \"status\": \"refused\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"n/a\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Bind pre-existing outrefs instead (MCP-CTX-01).\",\n      \"experiment\": \"CAT-T14/T14b/T14c/T14d.\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"n/a\",\n      \"category\": \"d\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-REF-09@0\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"F1\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1-draft-20261015\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-REF-10\",\n      \"version\": \"0\",\n      \"family\": \"REF\",\n      \"title\": \"Public input declared but not constrained by the relation\",\n      \"property\": \"A statement field that the relation