 program fixed by raw_source_sha256 accept pre_snapshot with input amount and produce post_snapshot\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"note\": \"Catalogue-normative statement type. An AdmissionRecord maps every constraint id to a relation locator and pins every circuit-constant field; naming a field in a constraint is not evidence that a relation enforces it. The circuit's snapshot representation is not fixed; Bytes32 slots are the catalogue's normative slot type.\"\n      },\n      \"anchorType\": \"none\",\n      \"semanticsId\": \"moriarty-core/1 hand-lowered action pay of payment.mori over P-L0\",\n      \"resultSchema\": \"accept/reject of the relation over the typed statement; no ledger result\",\n      \"auditRef\": \"groth16-preprod-independent-opus-review-20261015/root-owned-attempt-2/FINAL-RESPONSE.md sha256 62fbdee0341f410684449d72e09e515a99d5c8d94d8b16cb489ab4267b7ed238 (APPROVE_SCOPED_RESEARCH_RESULT for X0-X5 observations; X6 binding design not approved)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-EXE-07\",\n      \"version\": \"2\",\n      \"family\": \"EXE\",\n      \"title\": \"Computation over provider-supplied transaction bytes\",\n      \"property\": \"Bytes B hash (BLAKE2b-256) to txid t, and a specified decoding of B yields output i = (address, value, datum), for any accepted template shape.\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"computation\",\n      \"temporalScope\": \"bytes of one transaction\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"T02\",\n        \"X-PLAN\",\n        \"X-G16REPORT\",\n        \"A-G16\",\n        \"A-CATV1\"\n      ],\n      \"publicInputs\": \"t and the extracted fields.\",\n      \"privateWitness\": \"B.\",\n      \"anchorAndAssumptions\": \"Blake2b-256 collision resistance; decoder correctness for the accepted template.\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"Bytes immutable.\",\n      \"strategy\": \"Hash gadget in circuit (costly) or validator-side hashing.\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"The general relation (a Conway body parser circuit) is not implemented. One template-shape instance is MCP-PLN-01@2 (G16 audit 62fbdee0, scoped). Per-shape circuits fragment setup (author-reported eligibility 0/193, then 16/193 after Amendment A1).\",\n      \"status\": \"conditional-construction\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"A general body-parser relation; an inclusion anchor (MCP-LED-01/02/03) before any ledger meaning.\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Could authenticate an action input only after anchoring; until then it is a computation about provided data.\",\n      \"experiment\": \"Sibling X1-X3 as executed by the author; independent audit pending.\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"Inclusion in Preprod, unspentness, finality.\",\n      \"category\": \"c\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-EXE-07@2\",\n      \"supersedes\": \"MCP-EXE-07@1\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"A8: the general relation returns to conditional-construction; the single-shape instance is MCP-PLN-01@2 (audit recommendation plus author agreement)\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1.1-draft-20261015\",\n      \"categoryChange\": {\n        \"from\": \"b\",\n        \"to\": \"c\",\n        \"reason\": \"A8: one template shape does not evidence the general relation\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-REC-03\",\n      \"version\": \"1\",\n      \"family\": \"REC\",\n      \"title\": \"G16 local Groth16 verifier cost (experiment record)\",\n      \"property\": \"The G16 experiment author reports about 2.13e9 CPU / 13.6e3 mem for one Aiken/UPLC Groth16 verification under Aiken v1.1.21's built-in cost model; the independent G16 audit agrees as labelled: an Aiken-model number, not the Preprod epoch-319 cost model, with no validator or ScriptContext overhead. Preserved contradiction, not merged: 1.36-1.61e9 (bridge KB, MCP-REC-02@1), about 2.13e9 (this record), ~23% (CIP-0381 preliminary), 'a fifth to a quarter' (cardano-zk.txt:108).\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"external-record\",\n      \"temporalScope\": \"the G16 run\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"X-G16REPORT\",\n        \"S-REVIEW-CAT\",\n        \"S-CARDANOZK\",\n        \"A-G16\",\n        \"A-CATV1\"\n      ],\n      \"publicInputs\": \"n/a\",\n      \"privateWitness\": \"n/a\",\n      \"anchorAndAssumptions\": \"Author-reported local measurement under Aiken's cost model, not the Preprod epoch-319 model.\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"Cost-model specific.\",\n      \"strategy\": \"Budget input only; never merged with external records.\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"G16 audit 62fbdee0 sections 5, 9 and 12 (X5 approved as labelled).\",\n      \"status\": \"experiment-observed-audited\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"Re-measure under the Preprod epoch-319 cost model.\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Budget input only.\",\n      \"experiment\": \"Track 05 E3 under the pinned Preprod cost model.\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"Fit under Preprod; any ledger fact.\",\n      \"category\": \"b\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-REC-03@1\",\n      \"supersedes\": \"MCP-REC-03@0\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"A9: external-record (a sibling's self-report), not an observation by this task (audit judgment plus author agreement)\",\n        \"A11: G16 audit 62fbdee0 agrees with the X5 cost observation as labelled (only status in v1.1 that moves upward; flagged for review)\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1.1-draft-20261015\",\n      \"auditRef\": \"groth16-preprod-independent-opus-review-20261015/root-owned-attempt-2/FINAL-RESPONSE.md sha256 62fbdee0341f410684449d72e09e515a99d5c8d94d8b16cb489ab4267b7ed238 (APPROVE_SCOPED_RESEARCH_RESULT for X0-X5 observations; X6 binding design not approved)\",\n      \"kindChange\": {\n        \"from\": \"observation\",\n        \"to\": \"external-record\",\n        \"reason\": \"A9: sibling self-report, not an observation recorded by this task\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-LIN-05\",\n      \"version\": \"2\",\n      \"family\": \"LIN\",\n      \"title\": \"One-ticket-per-credential nullifier burn\",\n      \"property\": \"Conditional on ticket issuance being unique per credential C: a claim must spend a custody UTxO and a ticket UTxO, i.e. a script-address UTxO with datum Ticket n where n = Blake2b(domainSep || scriptHash || C), consumed without a successor ticket output [P-SP2REC lines 16-23]; under that condition a second claim for C finds no ticket. Ticket creation is unconstrained in the captured validator source, so without that condition the property does not hold.\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"ledger-current-context\",\n      \"temporalScope\": \"from ticket creation\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"B-PREVIEW\",\n        \"P-SP2REC\",\n        \"P-REDVAL\",\n        \"S-REVIEW-CAT\",\n        \"A-CATV1\"\n      ],\n      \"publicInputs\": \"n.\",\n      \"privateWitness\": \"Credential secret.\",\n      \"anchorAndAssumptions\": \"Ticket issuance uniqueness; LIN-01.\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"Permanent on the fork.\",\n      \"strategy\": \"Ledger-native replay record.\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"External Preview record only (MCP-REC-01@1), author-reported.\",\n      \"status\": \"conditional-construction\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"A ticket-issuance minting policy that makes ticket creation unique per C; Moriarty has no credential/claim construct.\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Pattern for consumed-message records in bridge claims [B-REQ item 3].\",\n      \"experiment\": \"Two claims for the same C in one tx and across txs; both second attempts must fail.\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"Uniqueness if ticket issuance itself can be duplicated. Ticket creation is not constrained by any minting policy in the captured validator source [P-REDVAL]; because n is computable from public data, a second Ticket n UTxO could be locked by anyone [INF; Recovery.Logic ticketBurnedFor not captured, GAP]. The record shows a ticket-datum UTxO created by an ordinary lock transaction (2969eb5f..., tx 2 in P-SP2REC) and an author-reported mis-encoded one (e73dfb35...#2) that the author states is undecodable: evidence of unconstrained creation, not of two valid tickets for one n.\",\n      \"category\": \"c\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-LIN-05@2\",\n      \"supersedes\": \"MCP-LIN-05@1\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"A12: property made conditional on unique ticket issuance; status conditional-construction (audit recommendation plus author agreement); F10 wording correction accepted as unverified by the audit\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1.1-draft-20261015\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"MCP-REF-11\",\n      \"version\": \"0\",\n      \"family\": \"REF\",\n      \"title\": \"Negative-control or test key admitted under a production predicate identity\",\n      \"property\": \"Accepting a VK whose relation is a negative control (for example a circuit with a binding constraint removed) or a test key under a production predicate identity. Its circuit constants (predicate and template digests) can equal the production ones, so digest checks and pairing checks alone do not distinguish it.\",\n      \"claimKind\": \"anti-pattern\",\n      \"temporalScope\": \"Any admission\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"A-G16\",\n        \"A-CATV1\"\n      ],\n      \"publicInputs\": \"n/a\",\n      \"privateWitness\": \"n/a\",\n      \"anchorAndAssumptions\": \"A control key verifies forged statements by construction.\",\n      \"freshnessValidity\": \"n/a\",\n      \"strategy\": \"AdmissionRecord key_role in {production, negative-control, test}; admission and bundles refuse every non-production key (ADM_KEY_ROLE_NOT_PRODUCTION, BND_KEY_ROLE_NOT_PRODUCTION); consumers also pin accepted vk_digests.\",\n      \"implementationEvidence\": \"G16 X3: the unbound control VK reuses the P-L0 predicate and template constants (G16 audit F2). UNIT falsifiers ADM-T23, BND-T23, BND-T23b, BND-T23c in this task.\",\n      \"status\": \"refused\",\n      \"firstBlocker\": \"n/a\",\n      \"moriartyRelation\": \"Applies to every proof-carrying row.\",\n      \"experiment\": \"n/a\",\n      \"notEstablished\": \"That a record's declared key_role is truthful; a mislabelled control key is caught only by relation review and the consumer's vk pin.\",\n      \"category\": \"d\",\n      \"versionedId\": \"MCP-REF-11@0\",\n      \"changeReason\": [\n        \"A3 (independent catalogue audit 7f35c079): new anti-pattern row\"\n      ],\n      \"introducedIn\": \"1.1-draft-20261015\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","catalogueSource":{"path":"evidence/utxo/cardano-catalogue-inventory-graph-2026-10-17/attribution-packet/CATALOGUE-v1.2.json","sha256":"df4b6dde15bfcb7848fcef024ff6fb8ea6902fb0625ebf837c3f89254c7343a6","commit":null}}
